Package: fraiseqlclient
Title: FraiseQL Arrow Flight Client
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("FraiseQL", "Contributors", email = "dev@fraiseql.dev", role = c("aut", "cre"))
)
Description: Arrow Flight client for FraiseQL enabling zero-copy integration with R
    statistical analysis and data manipulation workflows. Supports GraphQL queries,
    direct view reads and batched queries, with direct Arrow/RecordBatch consumption.
    Observer event streaming is not offered: the server answers ObserverEvents with
    'unimplemented'.
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports:
    arrow,
    jsonlite,
    reticulate
Suggests:
    dplyr,
    tidyr
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.9) with pyarrow, reached through reticulate
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.2.0
